<title>UK: UPDATE.</title>
<headline>UPDATE.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Moves to a fresh seven year high of $1,658 on renewed short-covering. Fuundamentals strong, stocks down again. COPPER - Drifts lower under light speculative selling. Stocks rise dampens sentiment. NICKEL - Higher as buy stops continue to be triggered. ALUMINIUM - Moves to test resistance at $1,700. OTHERS - Quiet.</p>
</text>
